post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'
==> These are Apple's sounds. Read /usr/share/licenses/macos-sequoia-sound-theme/NOTICE.txt
    before using them, and do not redistribute the built package.
==> Select the theme in System Settings > Colors & Themes > System Sounds > macOS Sequoia.
    The 14 macOS alert sounds are also in /usr/share/sounds/macos-sequoia/alerts/ if you
    want to assign one to a particular notification.
MSG
}
